pth & specialism</h3><p style=\"margin:0;color:var(--ink-70);\">Deeper residencies paired with advanced coursework in a chosen area of software engineering.</p></div><div class=\"ise-card\"><p class=\"ise-eyebrow\" style=\"margin-bottom:.4rem;\">Year 4</p><h3 style=\"margin:0 0 .5rem;\">Master's project</h3><p style=\"margin:0;color:var(--ink-70);\">A capstone master's project, often with an industry partner, completing the integrated MSc.</p></div></div>\n</div></div>"}, "elements": []}]}]}, {"id": "d6bb8ac", "elType": "section", "settings": {"content_width": "full", "gap": "no", "padding": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "0", "left": "0", "isLinked": true}, "margin": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "0", "left": "0", "isLinked": true}, "structure": "10"}, "elements": [{"id": "4c1336c", "elType": "column", "settings": {"_column_size": 100, "_inline_size": null, "padding": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "0", "left": "0", "isLinked": true}, "margin": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "0", "left": "0", "isLinked": true}}, "elements": [{"id": "40e9ddc", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "html", "settings": {"html": "<div class=\"ise-band--green\" style=\"padding-block:var(--section-y);\">\n<div class=\"ise-container\" style=\"text-align:center;max-width:760px;\">\n  <h2 style=\"color:#fff;\">Applications for 2026 are open</h2>\n  <p style=\"color:#e7f2ec;font-size:var(--fs-lead);\">Apply through the CAO with code LM173, or talk to our team about residencies and partnerships.</p>\n  <div style=\"display:flex;gap:1rem;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:1.5rem;\">\n    <a class=\"ise-btn ise-btn--on-dark\" href=\"/apply\">Apply — LM173</a>\n    <a class=\"ise-btn ise-btn--ghost ise-btn--on-dark\" href=\"/companies\">Become a partner</a>\n  </div>\n</div></div>"}, "elements": []}]}]}, {"id": "d637c7f", "elType": "section", "settings": {"content_width": "full", "gap": "no", "padding": {"